OL,3,CPrisoner who fled vehicle outside
OL,4,CLiverpool Magistrates Court back in
OL,5,Ccustody
OL,7,FA man who went on the run for three
OL,8,Fdays after fleeing from a custody van
OL,9,Foutside Liverpool Magistrates' Court
OL,10,Fhas been arrested.
OL,12,FStephen Grzyb, 22 was being
OL,13,Ftransported from Belle Vale custody
OL,14,Fsuite by GEOAmey, a private contractor
OL,15,Fon Saturday 1 August. At around 10am
OL,16,Fhe made off on foot down Red Cross
OL,17,FStreet in the direction of The Strand.
OL,19,FGrzyb had been due before magistrates
OL,20,Fcharged with a domestic-related
OL,21,Fburglary.
