OL,3,CPrisoner who fled vehicle outside
OL,4,CLiverpool Magistrates Court back in
OL,5,Ccustody
OL,7,FA GEOAmey spokesperson previously said:
OL,9,F"We can confirm a male prisoner
OL,10,Fabsconded from custody while being
OL,11,Ftransported to Liverpool Crown Court.
OL,13,F"We have begun an investigation into
OL,14,Fthe circumstances surrounding the
OL,15,Fincident and cannot comment further
OL,16,Fwhilst that investigation is underway."
